---
import InnerPage from '../layouts/InnerPage.astro';
import { BOOK_CALL_URL } from '../config/site';
---

<InnerPage
	title="About"
	description="TeleTrex builds fast, friendly AI for startups and small businesses—practical systems, not science projects."
>
	<h1>About TeleTrex</h1>
	<p class="page-lead">
		We’re an AI agency for teams that care about <strong>margin, momentum, and sanity</strong>. If you’re
		tired of growth costing a linear jump in headcount or of losing deals to slow follow-up, we’re built
		for you.
	</p>

	<p class="prose-block">
		Our bias is toward <strong>plain language and shipped solutions that perform</strong>.
    We work to understand your business, the pain, the grind, and the obstacles,
		and work to design a future view that your teams will adopt, adapt, and use. This future view will drive how we design assistants and workflows from first principles with our powerful tooling.
	</p>

	<p class="prose-block">
		You don’t need a technical background to work with us. We will work with you to build a clear picture
    of what “better” looks like, a clear path forward, and deliver the most effective solution possible.
	</p>

	<h2 class="section-title">What we believe</h2>
	<ul class="prose-block bullets">
		<li>The user is at the center of everything we do. You, your users, your prospects, your partners.</li>
		<li>AI should reduce repetitive work, and not add a new maze to manage</li>
		<li>We are here only to deliver solutions we are both proud of that deliver
    tangible results to your business. If it doesn’t move a real metric
    (time, revenue, satisfaction), it’s not done</li>
	</ul>

	<p class="prose-block about-cta">
		<a class="btn btn--primary" href={BOOK_CALL_URL}>Book a call today.</a>
	</p>
</InnerPage>

<style>
	.bullets {
		padding-left: 1.25rem;
	}

	.bullets li {
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.about-cta {
		margin-top: 2rem;
	}
</style>
